  <result type="2">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results achieved</narrative>
    <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats atteints</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results achieved</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats atteints</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">Parmi les r&#xe9;sultats obtenus jusqu&#x2019;en mars 2022 : 1) le renforcement de la capacit&#xe9; des &#xc9;tats membres de l&#x2019;ANASE &#xe0; r&#xe9;pondre aux menaces que repr&#xe9;sentent les agents pathog&#xe8;nes &#xe9;mergents et dangereux; 2) le renforcement des capacit&#xe9;s nationales et r&#xe9;gionales en mati&#xe8;re de s&#xe9;curit&#xe9; sanitaire.</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results achieved as of March 2022 include: (1) enhanced capacity of ASEAN member states to respond to threats of emerging and dangerous pathogens; and (2) strengthened national and regional health-security capabilities.</narrative>
    </description>
   </indicator>
  </result>
  <result type="2">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expected Results</narrative>
    <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results expected</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">Les r&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s de ce projet comprennent : 1) un renforcement de la r&#xe9;ponse r&#xe9;gionale et nationale aux urgences sanitaires multirisques; 2) une am&#xe9;lioration des capacit&#xe9;s de bios&#xe9;curit&#xe9;, de s&#xfb;ret&#xe9; biologique et de surveillance des maladies; 3) un renforcement des capacit&#xe9;s nationales des &#xc9;tats membres de l&#x2019;ANASE &#xe0; r&#xe9;pondre rapidement et efficacement aux incidents biologiques d&#xe9;lib&#xe9;r&#xe9;s.</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">The expected outcomes of this project include: (1) strengthened regional and national response to multi-hazard health security emergencies; (2) improved biosafety, biosecurity and disease surveillance capabilities; and (3) increased national capabilities of ASEAN member states to respond rapidly, efficiently and effectively to deliberate biological incidents.</narrative>
    </description>
   </indicator>
  </result>
